 "brief": "Settler militias escalated attacks on Palestinians and their property across the occupied West Bank over the past 24 hours, Shehab Wire reported. The assaults targeted residential homes, agricultural land, and communities in multiple locations throughout the territory, continuing a pattern of recurring violence against civilian populations.\n\nThe incidents occurred in scattered areas of the West Bank and involved damage to homes and agricultural holdings. The attacks by settler groups represent an ongoing threat to Palestinian civilians and their possessions in occupied territory, with similar incidents reported with frequency across the region.",
